<rml>
<head>
	<title>Campaign</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../rcss/menu.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../rcss/match.rcss"/>
</head>
<!--
The campaign (SinglePlayerPage.tsx): the original game's tiers of arenas, its five skills, the marks
of the arenas won and the medal case. Its data is campaign and campaign_tiers, filled from the
career's campaign (oz_ui_profile.cpp, P12): the tiers and their arenas (each by its index in the
engine's maps, which gives its name, level shot and bots), the open tiers, the best skill each arena
was won at, the medals.

An arena starts as the game's single player (g_gametype 2) on the chosen skill: the game spawns the
arena's bots and sets its limits, and its postgame gives the campaign its awards. The results go back
here, through the tier's movie when a tier is finished.
-->
<body data-model="menu">
	<div class="panel">
		<div class="corners"><div class="tl"/><div class="tr"/><div class="bl"/><div class="br"/></div>
		<div class="topline"/>
		<div class="phead">
			<div><banner text="Campaign"/><p class="subtitle">The original game's campaign: fight through the tiers of arenas to reach the final duel. Win every arena of a tier to open the next.</p></div>
			<div class="backbtn" onclick="back"><kbd>Esc</kbd><span>Back</span></div>
		</div>
		<div class="divider"/>
		<div class="pbody">
			<div class="cols tight">
				<div class="main">
					<div class="ctop">
						<div id="cp_tier" class="spinner" autofocus="" spin="campaign.tier" data-attr-options="campaign.tier_options">
							<span class="arrow prev">&lt;</span>
							<span class="v">{{ campaign_tiers[campaign.tier].name }}<span class="tick" data-if="campaign_tiers[campaign.tier].complete"/></span>
							<span class="arrow next">&gt;</span>
						</div>
						<div class="won"><span class="big">{{ campaign.won }}</span><span>/ {{ campaign.total }} arenas won</span></div>
						<div class="bar"><div class="fill" data-style-width="(campaign.won * 100 / campaign.total) + '%'"/></div>
					</div>
					<div class="tiers">
						<div class="arenas" data-for="t, k : campaign_tiers" data-if="k == campaign.tier" data-class-single="t.arenas.size == 1">
							<button class="acard" data-for="a : t.arenas" data-if="maps.size &gt; a.mi" data-class-locked="!t.open" data-attr-onclick="t.open ? 'campaign ' + maps[a.mi].map : 'sound buzz'">
								<div class="shotbox">
									<div class="img" data-style-decorator="maps[a.mi].shot != '' ? 'image(' + maps[a.mi].shot + ' cover)' : 'none'"/>
									<div class="fade"/>
									<img class="wonimg" data-if="a.won &gt; 0" data-attr-src="'/menu/art/level_complete' + a.won"/>
									<div class="lockv" data-if="!t.open"><span>Locked</span></div>
									<div class="cap">
										<div class="n">{{ maps[a.mi].name | plain }}</div>
										<div class="id">{{ maps[a.mi].map }} &#xb7; {{ maps[a.mi].fraglimit &gt; 0 ? maps[a.mi].fraglimit : 20 }} frags</div>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="vs">
									<span class="l">Vs</span>
									<span class="bot" data-for="b : bots" data-if="(maps[a.mi].bots.size &gt; 0 ? to_lower(b.name) == to_lower(maps[a.mi].bots[0]) : false) || (maps[a.mi].bots.size &gt; 1 ? to_lower(b.name) == to_lower(maps[a.mi].bots[1]) : false) || (maps[a.mi].bots.size &gt; 2 ? to_lower(b.name) == to_lower(maps[a.mi].bots[2]) : false) || (maps[a.mi].bots.size &gt; 3 ? to_lower(b.name) == to_lower(maps[a.mi].bots[3]) : false) || (maps[a.mi].bots.size &gt; 4 ? to_lower(b.name) == to_lower(maps[a.mi].bots[4]) : false) || (maps[a.mi].bots.size &gt; 5 ? to_lower(b.name) == to_lower(maps[a.mi].bots[5]) : false) || (maps[a.mi].bots.size &gt; 6 ? to_lower(b.name) == to_lower(maps[a.mi].bots[6]) : false)"><img data-attr-src="b.icon"/><span>{{ b.name }}</span></span>
								</div>
							</button>
						</div>
					</div>
					<p class="warn" data-if="!campaign_tiers[campaign.tier].open">Locked: win every arena of the tier before it to open {{ campaign_tiers[campaign.tier].name }}.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="side narrow">
					<div class="section first"><span class="t">Skill</span><span class="rule"/></div>
					<div class="skills">
						<button class="skb" data-for="s, i : create_match.skills" data-class-sel="campaign.skill == i + 1" onclick="sound move" data-event-click="campaign.skill = i + 1"><img data-attr-src="'/menu/art/skill' + (i + 1)"/></button>
					</div>
					<div class="skname">{{ create_match.skills[campaign.skill - 1] }}</div>
					<div class="section"><span class="t">Medals</span><span class="rule"/></div>
					<div class="medals">
						<div class="medal" data-for="md : campaign.medals" data-class-none="md.count == 0">
							<img data-attr-src="md.img"/>
							<div class="l">{{ md.label }}</div>
							<div class="c">{{ md.count }}</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<p class="cnote">Medals add up over every campaign match, won or lost. Each arena keeps the highest skill you beat it on.</p>
					<div class="creset"><button class="btn small" onclick="campaignreset"><span>Reset campaign</span></button></div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
